#AREA GreyStone Village~
#AUTHORS Prophecy~
#RANGES 5 15 0 99
#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG|AFLAG_NOCASTLE|AFLAG_FREEQUIT


#HELPS
1 greystone~
{120}GreyStone Village
{020}-----------------
{300}Greystone Village located outside the grand city of chakkor is reknown for
its fine craftsmen and the Fameous Order of the Forest Runners. The Forest
Runners are know for their long feud with an Occult who are bent on destroying
the forests of the Realms. It is rumored that thier favorite weapons are
stained with the blood of these defilers and have magical properties.

Date Implemented:  7/19/03
Date Updated    : 12/18/03
~
2 greystone_update~
{120}Greystone Village Updates
{020}-------------------------
{300}12/14/04 - Fixed Spider to drop silk upon death at all times. By Prophecy
         - Removed curse from Forest Pixie, too much spam in logs. By Prophecy
~
0 $~

#MOBILES
#33000
gho gho'don~
Gho'Don~
Gho'don the armorer is here.~
Gho'don is an older gentlemen. Appearing to be in his late fourties. He seems
to be a wisened man. His arms and skin show the traits of his trade. Well
built and tanned from being near the forge on a constant basis.
~
ACT_BODY|ACT_IS_NPC|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_RACE|ACT_SMART|ACT_SENTINEL
AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
1 BODY_HEAD BODY_HAND 1d1+0 1d1+0
0 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 99~
  if ispc($n)
  if actorhasobjnum(33049)
    say You know I can help you turn that copper ring
    say into something powerful!
    say If you would be willing to help me?
  endif
endif
~
>rand_prog 15~
say Can I interest you into buy a copper ring today?
~
>speech_prog help~
say Why yes...
say But I need a few items first!
mpmset $n quest 2 8 1
~
>speech_prog items~
if quest(2,8,$n) == 1
say Yes, first I need the correct mold to reshape the ring!
say Find me the correct mold and bring it back to me!
endif
mpmset $n quest 2 8 2
~
>give_prog I33050~
mpjunk i33050
if quest(2,8,$n) == 2
say Excellent....
say Now I need some magic dust to infuse with the ring!
endif
mpmset $n quest 2 8 3
~
>give_prog I33051~
mpjunk i33051
if quest(2,8,$n) == 3
say Wonderful...
say You have no idea how hard this is to retrieve...
say Well I guess you do...!
frown
say There is one problem though!
endif
mpmset $n quest 2 8 4
~
>speech_prog problem~
if quest(2,8,$n) == 4
say The gem I needed for all of this is back at my house!
endif
mpmset $n quest 2 8 5
~
>speech_prog house~
if quest(2,8,$n) == 5
say Why, yes...
say But I locked a terrifying monster in there!
say Maybe your brave enough to get the gem for me?
mpoload 33034
give key $n
say There is the key to the chest!
say Good Luck!
endif
mpmset $n quest 2 8 6
~
>give_prog I33035~
mpjunk i33035
if quest(2,8,$n) == 6
say Wonderful you did it...!
say Now lets see here...!
say All I need now is for you to give me the ring!
endif
mpmset $n quest 2 8 7
~
>give_prog I33049~
mpjunk i33049
if quest(2,8,$n) == 7
say This will do fine!
recho Gho'Don takes the Copper Ring and begins to melt it down!
recho The ring begins to glow red and liquifies!
recho Gho'Don pours the liquid copper into the mold....
say Ahhh good it is working.
recho Gho'Don grabs a pinch of Pixie Dust and adds it to the molten metal!
recho CRACKLE.. FIZZLE... POP....
recho Gho'Don breaks the mold and sets the stone in the red hot ring!
recho Gho'Don dunks the ring in water...!
recho SIZZLE....
say Its done
mpoload 33059
give ring $n
say Now be careful with it...! Its a rare artifact...!
endif
mpmset $n quest 2 8 8
~
|
