nidajo apothecary~
Nidajo~
Nidajo is here brewing up some potions.~
Nidajo is a crazy old man, who loves his work way to much. He is a short lil
halfling who's been withered and worn. Working as hard as he can. He doesn't
even know his hat is smoking.
~
ACT_IS_NPC|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_SENTINEL
AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
