95 BODY_HEAD BODY_HAND 1d1+0 1d1+0
0 RACE_HALFLING
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>greet_prog 100~
if quest(1,8,$n) == 2
say Have you brought the items I have asked for?
else
say Greetings Traveller!
say May I be of some service today?
endif
~
>rand_prog 20~
say Maybe you can be of some Help to me?
~
>speech_prog help~
say I am attempting to make a new candle.
say One that will repel pests and insects.
say But I don't have the Supplies.
say Maybe you help me fetch them?
mpmset $n quest 1 8 1
~
>speech_prog supplies~
if quest(1,8,$n) == 1
say Why yes, This is what I need!
say Some form of wax for the candle.
say Something that repels insects.
say Some silk string to use as a wick.
say And a mold of some sort.
say And something to light the fire on my stove.
say Fetch all of these items and return to me.
endif
mpmset $n quest 1 8 2
~
>speech_prog yes~
if quest(1,8,$n) == 2
say Excellent..!
say Now give me what you found to get the fire going..!
endif
~
>speech_prog no~
if quest(1,8,$n) == 2
say Well than hurry and fetch me those items.
endif
~
>give_prog I33003~
mpjunk i33003
if quest(1,8,$n) == 2
recho Nidajo takes the flint and Lights the fire on his stove!
say Excellent, Now give me the clay mold!
mpmset $n quest 1 8 3
endif
~
>give_prog I33004~
mpjunk i33004
if quest(1,8,$n) == 3
recho Nidajo takes the clay mold and sets it on the stove!
say Good, now give me the wax!
mpmset $n quest 1 8 4
endif
~
>give_prog I33008~
mpjunk i33008
if quest(1,8,$n) == 4
recho Places the candle in the mold and melts down the wax.
say Wonderful, now I just need something that repels insects?
mpmset $n quest 1 8 5
endif
~
>give_prog I33006~
mpjunk i33006
if quest(1,8,$n) == 5
recho Nidajo stirs the cedar shavings into the wax!
say Good.. Now we just need a wick..!
mpmset $n quest 1 8 6
endif
~
>give_prog I33043~
mpjunk i33043
if quest(1,8,$n) == 6
recho Nidajo dips the string into the wax!
recho Nidajo takes the mold off the stove and lets it cool.
recho Nidajo cracks the mold open!
mpquiet on
mpoload 33009
mpquiet off
recho A red brown candle appears from the mold!
say There you go!
say Now go and try it!
give candle $n
endif
~
>give_prog I33050~
give circular $n
say You might wanna try a better shaped mold.
~
